去大半。\"}","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:42","timestamp":1779849727108,"roundId":"round_1779849719986_xuxc21146","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":16546},{"id":1779848482443,"text":"伦敦飞苏黎世很快，不到两个小时。然后转火车进山，一路上风景很好，你可以睡一觉或者看雪景，不折腾。","rawContent":"伦敦飞苏黎世很快，不到两个小时。然后转火车进山，一路上风景很好，你可以睡一觉或者看雪景，不折腾。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:42","timestamp":1779849730401,"roundId":"round_1779849719986_xuxc21146","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":16547},{"id":1779848482444,"text":"算我口误。我们沈老板上次在国内雪场可是能自己滑一段的，确实不是零基础了。","rawContent":"算我口误。我们沈老板上次在国内雪场可是能自己滑一段的，确实不是零基础了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:42","timestamp":1779849733317,"roundId":"round_1779849719986_xuxc21146","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":16548},{"id":1779848482445,"text":"但瑞士那边的雪道情况跟国内不太一样，为了安全起见，到了那边我还是得先带你复习一下。","rawContent":"但瑞士那边的雪道情况跟国内不太一样，为了安全起见，到了那边我还是得先带你复习一下。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:42","timestamp":1779849736355,"roundId":"round_1779849719986_xuxc21146","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":16549},{"id":1779848482446,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[VOICE: （低笑）你放心，我肯定贴身护着你，不会让你摔。滑累了我们就回木屋泡私汤，吃奶酪火锅。怎么样，这个安排能让你把刚才的‘气’消了吗？]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:42","timestamp":1779849737257,"roundId":"round_1779849719986_xuxc21146","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"（低笑）你放心，我肯定贴身护着你，不会让你摔。滑累了我们就回木屋泡私汤，吃奶酪火锅。怎么样，这个安排能让你把刚才的‘气’消了吗？","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":16550},{"id":1779848482447,"text":"你下午打算干嘛？写那篇导师的论文还是找灵感？","rawContent":"你下午打算干嘛？写那篇导师的论文还是找灵感？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:42","timestamp":1779849740174,"roundId":"round_1779849719986_xuxc21146","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":16551},{"id":1779848482448,"text":"没事干不行吗","sender":"me","time":"10:42","timestamp":1779849760201,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":16552},{"id":1779848482449,"sender":"them","text":"陆驰没忍住轻笑出声。他身体往下滑了滑，舒服地靠在枕头上，看着屏幕的眼神彻底软了下来。","timestamp":1779849777535,"tempo":"N","type":"state","rawContent":"陆驰没忍住轻笑出声。他身体往下滑了滑，舒服地靠在枕头上，看着屏幕的眼神彻底软了下来。","roundId":"round_1779849760938_rq7unpyot","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":16553},{"id":1779848482450,"sender":"them","text":"行，太行了。你现在是放假，又赶上生理期，最大的任务就是什么都不干。","timestamp":1779849780320,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"行，太行了。你现在是放假，又赶上生理期，最大的任务就是什么都不干。","roundId":"round_1779849760938_rq7unpyot","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":16554},{"id":1779848482451,"sender":"them","text":"理直气壮地躺着就行。","timestamp":1779849783169,"tempo":"R","rawContent":"理直气壮地躺着就行。","roundId":"round_1779849760938_rq7unpyot","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":16555},{"id":1779848482452,"sender":"them","text":"[語音消息]","timestamp":1779849784320,"tempo":"N","isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"既然没事干，要把视频打开吗？你把手机架在旁边，发呆也行，看剧也行。我在这边躺着陪你，顺便补我的觉。你要是困了，我就看着你睡。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"calm","rawContent":"[語音消息]","roundId":"round_1779849760938_rq7unpyot","userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":16556},{"id":1779848482453,